        "validation_count": 32,
        "title": {
          "ja": "SHAKEとRATTLE：拘束と運動量の違い",
          "en": "SHAKE and RATTLE: constraints and momentum ownership"
        },
        "summary": {
          "ja": "単振り子の10固定軌道で、位置拘束、全時刻の接線運動量と内部点の中心化運動量を区別します。",
          "en": "Ten fixed pendulum evolutions distinguish position constraints, full-time tangent momentum and interior centered momentum."
        },
        "assumptions": {
          "ja": "L=m=g=1、初期角0.7、初期角速度0。C=(q·q−1)/2、T=100、h=0.04/0.02/0.01。拘束目標1e−13と粗格子の1e−10比較を固定。",
          "en": "L=m=g=1, initial angle 0.7 and zero angular velocity. C=(q·q−1)/2, T=100 and h=0.04/0.02/0.01; position targets are fixed at 1e−13, with a coarse 1e−10 companion."
        },
        "algorithm": {
          "ja": "独自のスカラーNewton位置拘束、RATTLE終端接線impulse、SHAKE位置対。SHAKEの運動量は内部点だけで中心化し、端点を作りません。 SHAKEのsolves列はeta、eta/h^2、位置残差、Newton更新数です。列1は一律にeta/h^2ですが、初回半刻みの物理乗数は2eta/h^2、以後の位置Verletではeta/h^2です。逆位置対はすべて後者です。判定と図はこの列1を使いません。",
          "en": "Original scalar Newton position constraints, RATTLE final tangent impulses and SHAKE position pairs. SHAKE momentum is centered only at interior nodes; endpoint momenta are absent. SHAKE solves columns are eta, eta/h^2, position residual and Newton updates. Column1 uses the uniform recurrence normalization eta/h^2. For the first constrained half-step startup, the physical multiplier is 2*eta/h^2; later full position-Verlet steps use eta/h^2. Reverse-pair steps all use the later recurrence convention. RATTLE has its separate five-column normalization. No scientific gate or plot uses SHAKE column1."
        },
        "validation": {
          "ja": "独立Jacobi解析族と角度系DOP853の資格、74主判定。有限Cの中心化恒等式、2段階FDの縮約写像診断、位置対／全状態の逆積分を分離。",
          "en": "A separately qualified Jacobi family and angular DOP853 reference support 74 main decisions. Finite-C centered identities, two-delta reduced-map diagnostics and position-pair versus full-state reversals are distinct."
        },
        "limits": {
          "ja": "原著SHAKE/RATTLE本文は未読で、著者講義ノートの選択箇所を確認。有限差分のsymplectic defectは一般証明ではなく、中心化SHAKE速度にRATTLEの接線拘束を要求しません。",
          "en": "Original SHAKE and RATTLE full texts remain unread; selected author lecture notes were inspected. The finite-difference symplectic defect is a local proxy, not a general proof, and centered SHAKE velocity is not assigned RATTLE tangency."
        },
        "review_level": {
          "ja": "一次資料の選択閲読と独立参照資格。実際の成否は保存result.jsonとverification.jsonに記録します。",
          "en": "Selected primary passages and separately qualified independent references. Actual outcomes are recorded in the saved result.json and verification.json."
        },
        "formulas": [
          "C(q)=\\tfrac12(q^Tq-1)=0",
          "q_{n+1}=q_n+h p_n+\\tfrac12h^2 f-\\eta_n q_n",
          "q_n^Tp_n^c=\\frac{\\|q_n-q_{n-1}\\|^2-\\|q_{n+1}-q_n\\|^2}{4h}+\\frac{C_{n+1}-C_{n-1}}{2h}"
        ],
